@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
title PUT /api/workspace/v1/messenger/drafts/{draft_uuid}
actor "客户端" as Client
participant "控制器 RestAlchemy" as API
database "草稿行 PostgreSQL" as DB
queue "内部域名 outbox" as OUT
queue "delivery_snapshot_event\ninternal/no public derivative" as TASK
Client -> API: PUT payload + If-Match
API -> DB: BEGIN; 阻止所有者草稿
API -> DB: 进行比较; 更新 payload + revision
API -> OUT: 增加内置 draft.updated
API -> DB: COMMIT
OUT -> TASK: immutable delivery_snapshot_event(outbox_event_uuid)
note right of TASK: effect guard; 没有完成 public event row
API --> Client: 200 草稿 + 新 ETag
@enduml
